    "description": {
      "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This black canister has yellow marks tracing holes that will light up with a blinding flash and a deafening boom.</p>\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-77963c87-7fff-7bd9-a255-5e443f0378a8\"><br />As an action, you can throw the flashbang to a point within 60 feet of you, where it explodes in a 10-foot-radius sphere. Each creature in the area must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or be blinded and deafened until the end of your next turn. If the creature is concentrating on a spell, they must also make a DC 10 Constitution saving throw to maintain concentration.</span></p>",
